This content checkout holds no company data.

It is PM OS's seed library: example skills, context, reviewers and templates written for
testing. A stack whose PMOS_MODEL_SOURCE is `hosted-test` (fake data only) refuses a content
checkout without this file, and any file in it marked `sensitivity: restricted`
(docs/openshell-any-host-spec.md §3.6). Remove this file from a content repository the
moment it holds anything real.
